{%- comment -%}
  Membership band, rendered globally above the footer by the
  customer-login-cta section.

  It has two faces, and which one shows is decided by whether the store is
  running its own promotions at all.

  With the welcome offer on, the band is that offer: "Enjoy 10% off your
  first perfume order". It used to be hidden from every signed-in customer,
  which meant the one person who could actually claim the discount — someone
  who had just made an account and not yet ordered — was the one person never
  shown it. It now follows the offer: a guest is asked to join, a member who
  has not ordered is given the button that puts the code on their bag, and a
  member carrying the code is told so. It disappears once the discount is
  spent.

  With promotions off — the state an exclusivity commitment to a cashback
  partner puts the store in — there is no discount to advertise, and the band
  does not invent one. An account is still worth having on its own terms:
  saved fragrances, order history, faster checkout. So the band keeps asking
  guests to join and simply stops promising money off. It is hidden from
  signed-in customers in that state, who already have everything it offers.

  What it never does in either state is mention cashback. That is a channel,
  advertised on the channel — the reasoning is in snippets/cashback-offer.liquid.

  The percentage and the code both come from Settings › Welcome offer, so the
  copy cannot drift away from the discount that Shopify will honour.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign wo_pct = settings.welcome_offer_percent | default: '10' | strip

  # The discount has a floor, so the band that advertises it says so. Kept as
  # cents for the money filter, exactly as welcome-offer does.
  assign wo_min = settings.welcome_offer_min | default: '' | strip
  assign wo_min_cents = 0
  if wo_min != blank
    assign wo_min_cents = wo_min | times: 100
  endif
  capture wo_over
    if wo_min_cents > 0
      echo ' on orders over '
      echo wo_min_cents | money_with_currency
    endif
  endcapture

  # The same three conditions welcome-offer tests, because the band and the
  # control inside it have to agree about whether an offer exists.
  assign wo_on = false
  if settings.promos_enabled and settings.welcome_offer_enabled and settings.welcome_offer_code != blank
    assign wo_on = true
  endif

  assign show_band = false
  if wo_on
    if customer
      if customer.orders_count == 0
        assign show_band = true
      endif
    else
      assign show_band = true
    endif
  else
    unless customer
      assign show_band = true
    endunless
  endif
-%}

{%- if show_band -%}
  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band member-band">
      <div class="member-copy">
        <span class="label" style="color:var(--gold)">Welcome to The Fragrance Secrets</span>

        {%- if wo_on -%}
          {%- if customer -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Deliberately stateless copy: whether the code is already on the
              bag is known inside welcome-offer, not here, and a headline that
              guessed would tell half the members the wrong thing. The control
              below carries the state; the heading just has to be true either
              way.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <h2 class="sec-title">Your {{ wo_pct }}% <em>Welcome Discount</em></h2>
            <p class="sec-sub">You're a member, so the welcome discount is yours on your first order{{ wo_over }} — it comes off the total at checkout. It sits alongside everything else in your account: saved fragrances, faster checkout, full order history and member-only offers through the year.</p>
          {%- else -%}
            <h2 class="sec-title">Enjoy {{ wo_pct }}% Off <em>Your First Perfume Order</em></h2>
            <p class="sec-sub">Create your free account and become part of The Fragrance Secrets community. Your {{ wo_pct }}% welcome discount is put on your bag the moment you join — no code to copy, no email to wait for{% if wo_min_cents > 0 %}, on any first order over {{ wo_min_cents | money_with_currency }}{% endif %}. Save your favourite fragrances, enjoy faster checkout, track every order, and unlock exclusive member-only offers throughout the year.</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <h2 class="sec-title">Create Your <em>Fragrance Account</em></h2>
          <p class="sec-sub">Join The Fragrance Secrets and keep your perfume life in one place. Save the fragrances you are deciding between, check out in a few taps with your details already filled in, and follow every order from dispatch to your door — across 218+ fragrance houses, all of them verified authentic.</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="cta-actions">
          {%- if wo_on -%}
            {% render 'welcome-offer', style: 'cta' %}
          {%- else -%}
            <a class="btn-g" href="{{ routes.account_register_url }}"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">person_add</span>Create your account</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="member-card">
        {%- if wo_on -%}
          <div class="mc-disc"><b>{{ wo_pct }}%</b><span>Welcome Discount</span></div>
          <div class="mc-perk"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">percent</span><div><b>Instant {{ wo_pct }}% welcome discount</b><span>{% if wo_min_cents > 0 %}On first orders over {{ wo_min_cents | money_with_currency }}{% else %}On your bag the moment you join{% endif %}</span></div></div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="mc-perk"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">favorite</span><div><b>Save your favourite fragrances</b><span>Build your personal wishlist</span></div></div>
        <div class="mc-perk"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">local_shipping</span><div><b>Track every order</b><span>Full order history in one place</span></div></div>
        <div class="mc-perk"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">bolt</span><div><b>Faster checkout</b><span>Saved details, fewer steps</span></div></div>
        {%- if wo_on -%}
          <div class="mc-perk"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">star</span><div><b>Exclusive member-only offers</b><span>Member drops all year round</span></div></div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="mc-perk"><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">verified</span><div><b>100% authentic, always</b><span>Verified sourcing on every bottle</span></div></div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
{%- endif -%}
